  "description": "File multiplexer with linked-block channels for .NET.\n\nWraps a base stream and lets multiple writers (channels, identified by 64-bit\ninteger IDs) share the same stream. Each channel's data is organized as a\ndoubly-linked list of blocks within the file. Acquisition of a channel holds\nan exclusive lock until dispose; backtracking via Seek walks the doubly-linked\nlist and only allocates a new block when the current block is full with no\nNextOffset. ExtendBlock provides explicit block allocation.",
  "id": "MultiplexedFile",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-07-19T07:09:52.093Z",
